# CLAUDE.md

## Project Overview

**MyApp** - React + FastAPI 기반 웹 애플리케이션

## Directory Structure

```
myapp/
├── src/
│   ├── backend/          # Python (FastAPI)
│   │   ├── api/          # API 라우터
│   │   ├── services/     # 비즈니스 로직
│   │   ├── db/           # SQLAlchemy ORM
│   │   └── models/       # 데이터 모델
│   └── frontend/         # React (Vite + Tailwind)
│       ├── components/   # UI 컴포넌트
│       ├── pages/        # 페이지
│       ├── stores/       # Zustand 스토어
│       └── hooks/        # 커스텀 훅
├── tests/                # 테스트
├── infra/                # Docker, 스크립트
└── docs/                 # 문서
```

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Stack |
|-------|-------|
| Backend | FastAPI, SQLAlchemy 2.0, PostgreSQL |
| Frontend | React 18, Zustand, Tailwind CSS, Vite, TypeScript |
| Infrastructure | Docker, nginx |

## Quick Start

```bash
# Backend
cd src/backend && pip install -e . && uvicorn api.app:app --reload

# Frontend
cd src/frontend && npm install && npm run dev
```

**URLs**: Backend `localhost:8000`, Frontend `localhost:5173`

## Commands

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `/check-health` | Type check, lint, test, build verification |
| `/verify-app` | Boris Cherny style verification loop |

## Environment Variables

```bash
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://user:pass@localhost:5432/myapp
SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key
```

## Testing

```bash
# Backend
cd src/backend && pytest

# Frontend
cd src/frontend && npm test
```

## Key Features

- User authentication (OAuth + Email/Password)
- RESTful API with OpenAPI docs
- Real-time WebSocket notifications
- Responsive dashboard UI
